tess girlfriends from all over the world. His fiancée Mona (Shouweikar), an Egyptian air-hostess, threatens to dump him if he doesn't quit his playboy lifestyle. Mounir thus decides to seek help from a prominent - albeit sexually frustrated - psychiatrist (Abdel Moneim Madbouly).","description_fr":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oRjk9nW47T1qLzR3RfeqDgea39.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ogftSHXu6KvpkKwy21fq4a2ozQh.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":null,"vote_count":null,"age_rating":null,"year":"1968","release_date":"1968-01-12","runtime_minutes":102,"status":"Released","country":"مصر","language":"العربية","genres":["كوميديا","رومنسية"],"genre_keys":["comedy","romance"],"similar":["mv194","mv603661","mv11700","mv9390","mv330493","mv459992","mv8874","mv86899"],"director":"نجدي حافظ","cast":[{"name":"فؤاد المهندس","character":"منير","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tNHdHVrkCvL9M4eJUDoOnfFRHzN.jpg"},{"name":"شويكار","character":"منى","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bWeR0PIZR1E809vfKEPXuH6vibn.jpg"},{"name":"عبدالمنعم مدبولي","character":"الدكتور خشبه","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/i0UKxWD32NJXYyUUIPHr9V9Vigw.jpg"},{"name":"مديحة كامل","character":"ماريا، المضيفة اﻹيطالية","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/l5HaBDR9knXllZRIAiX1oga8jjy.jpg"},{"name":"حسن مصطفى","character":"فانتوماس","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/AwjOe9xr4saKbCxAvFFoZggyUCS.jpg"},{"name":"محمود عزمي","character":"سامي","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/blLFjF48svCKE8GnbVSNIMm8whr.jpg"},{"name":"زوزو شكيب","character":null,"profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bPoUv99H2ytzrhW2Gc9Wr02DX5V.jpg"},{"name":"كوثر شفيق","character":"المضيفة اليابانية","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nZ2xIWAjSPxGE5HQM6PICP9Q1uB.jpg"},{"name":"شاهيناز طه","character":"المضيفة الأمريكية","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zMKDCNwjJN2RVWEv56k6jmyHXHh.jpg"},{"name":