iption":"يذهب عبدالمتجلي سليط المدرس الإلزامي القادم من القرية إلى لوكاندة الفردوس بعد أن لاقى عدم ترحيب من عطية الشلشلموني وزوجته شفيقة ومعه بناته الأربعة الذي يعاملهم بحزم وقوة، بينما كانت سميحة جارة عطية دائمة العراك مع زوجها مسعود بسبب غيرتها عليه، وتظن أنه على علاقة بأخرى.","description_en":"Abd al-Tajtali Sulayt, a compulsory teacher from the village, goes to Locanda al-Firdaws after he was greeted by Atiyah al-Shalashlamouni and his wife Shafiqa, along with his four daughters, who treat them firmly and strongly, while Samiha was a neighbor of Atiyah who was constantly fighting with her husband Masoud because of her jealousy over him, and she thinks that he is in a relationship with another.","description_fr":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOLmVfbY6TW6WKpXLQTIvuaqx5a.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8wehmcUSHfIdaF2QTznk1MrFdE.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":null,"vote_count":null,"age_rating":null,"year":"1964","release_date":"1964-07-08","runtime_minutes":160,"status":"Released","country":"مصر","language":"العربية","genres":["كوميديا","دراما","مسرحية"],"genre_keys":["comedy","drama"],"similar":["mv106646","mv194","mv493623","mv603661","mv116745","mv147773","mv9390","mv497828"],"director":"عبدالمنعم مدبولي","cast":[{"name":"عبدالمنعم مدبولي","character":"عطية الشلشلموني","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/i0UKxWD32NJXYyUUIPHr9V9Vigw.jpg"},{"name":"أمين الهنيدي","character":"عبدالمتجلي سليط","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uErmog3CsJGMXm9wpe4V2lHEazg.jpg"},{"name":"صلاح السعدني","character":"صبى الفندق","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/28grVfa5TiWx8JP7MteCPR0AGND.jpg"},{"name":"ثريا حلمي","character":null,"profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wav0IkpEypGe9I1u6gwKc1lKMuB.jpg"},{"name":"نجوى سالم","character":"سميحة","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dWXAj8aMx554QLpU4m7r9gEkWFo.jpg"},{"name":"زينب نصار","character":null,"profile_image":null},{"name":"سلامة إلياس